{
  "name": "6C - Campaign Outreach Strategy Planner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✍️Outreach Strategy Stage 3\n\n**Purpose**\nThe final enrichment stage. Uses all research from Stage 1 and 2 to create a complete, personalized outreach plan for each lead across all channels.\n\n**How it works**\nPicks Stage 2 leads → AI generates: email subject line, opening message, SMS text, WhatsApp message, LinkedIn connection note, best send time, and follow-up sequences → calculates final lead score → labels lead as **hot / warm / cold**.\n\n**Key Rules**\n- Lead score is calculated out of **100 points**\n- Score 75+ = 🔥 Hot | 55–74 = 🌡️ Warm | Below = 🧊 Cold\n- Sets `enrichment_stage = 3, lead is now ready for outreach",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 288
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        192,
        -576
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "de92abb4-59c3-4b06-be47-032733f6ce3f",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
