        "content": "## Campaign strategy planner\nReplaces legacy scoring and channel promotion. Campaign brief → queued draft → review → content approval. No legacy outreach flags are set and no messages are sent. Internal header-auth APIs require an authenticated org-binding gateway before Flutter use. AI is disabled by default and may only select approved text/source blocks. Original sticky note retained below as historical documentation.",
